1
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:42,880
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,410 --> 00:01:46,030
[Episode 27]

3
00:01:50,509 --> 00:01:51,509
Chunzhi.

4
00:01:54,759 --> 00:01:55,680
Your bow.

5
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:58,170
I've wrapped it for you.

6
00:02:31,710 --> 00:02:33,079
Since I married you,

7
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,800
in this life,

8
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:38,360
I will always be by your side.

9
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,960
The Marquis has just died,

10
00:03:19,150 --> 00:03:20,560
yet as his soldiers,

11
00:03:20,800 --> 00:03:22,660
how dare you massacre the people?

12
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,900
You also came from the people.

13
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:27,170
You also have family and parents.

14
00:03:27,310 --> 00:03:28,630
Is your courage

15
00:03:28,910 --> 00:03:30,840
all used to slaughter your own kin?

16
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:53,740
Fellow villagers!

17
00:03:54,030 --> 00:03:55,240
Fight them!

18
00:04:05,150 --> 00:04:05,710
Kill!

19
00:04:05,870 --> 00:04:06,430
Charge!

20
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,480
Stop!

21
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,920
Stop it, all of you!

22
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:54,800
I, Shen Run,

23
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,600
am here with the Marquis of Danyang.

24
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:58,000
Who dares to be insolent?

25
00:05:10,950 --> 00:05:11,680
You-

26
00:05:44,750 --> 00:05:45,950
Eunuch Xia.

27
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:48,360
I heard you served the late Emperor
for decades

28
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,750
without making a single mistake.

29
00:05:49,750 --> 00:05:51,070
How is it that when serving me,

30
00:05:51,070 --> 00:05:53,930
you can't even hold
a bowl of ginseng soup properly?

31
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,000
This old servant

32
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,050
deserves to die!

33
00:05:58,270 --> 00:06:00,270
I have done my best

34
00:06:00,270 --> 00:06:02,250
to serve Your Majesty for years.

35
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,240
From now on,

36
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:05,420
I will obey your edicts

37
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:06,870
and never act without your permission.

38
00:06:06,870 --> 00:06:09,560
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

39
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:13,420
You saw the situation in the court today.

40
00:06:13,870 --> 00:06:16,270
Hundreds of officials have impeached you.

41
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:19,620
Look at the bunch of people you've
taken under your wing

42
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,930
and the mess they've made of Hengtang.

43
00:06:22,270 --> 00:06:23,330
Peasant uprisings

44
00:06:24,390 --> 00:06:26,480
have been a sign of a nation’s downfall
since ancient times.

45
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,800
If I forgive you,

46
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,770
will the people forgive me?

47
00:06:30,390 --> 00:06:31,390
You better

48
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:34,240
drink this bowl of soup, Eunuch Xia.

49
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,270
Eunuch Xia.

50
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,610
Commander Shen.

51
00:07:24,830 --> 00:07:26,230
You made such a huge scene

52
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,780
capturing a mere County Sheriff.

53
00:07:29,390 --> 00:07:31,800
But here I am,
the dignified Commissioner Hu,

54
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:32,750
and you chose

55
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:35,070
to come along?

56
00:07:36,310 --> 00:07:37,710
You're hurting my pride.

57
00:07:40,270 --> 00:07:42,070
Outside, the public is furious.

58
00:07:42,870 --> 00:07:45,159
In court, the officials
are impeaching you.

59
00:07:45,159 --> 00:07:46,159
Isn't this scene

60
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:47,680
big enough?

61
00:07:48,430 --> 00:07:49,430
Commissioner Hu,

62
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,920
even at this point,

63
00:07:51,630 --> 00:07:53,240
you are still so greedy.

64
00:07:55,390 --> 00:07:56,390
I admit defeat.

65
00:07:59,270 --> 00:08:00,510
I lost to you.

66
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:03,720
Come.

67
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:07,160
Escort me to the capital now.

68
00:08:08,830 --> 00:08:10,630
No need to return to the capital.

69
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:33,789
Commissioner Hu.

70
00:08:36,150 --> 00:08:37,350
You've been drinking

71
00:08:37,390 --> 00:08:40,120
this aged wine since the time
of the late emperor.

72
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,929
It's time to change your taste.

73
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:49,320
Try this wine bestowed upon you
by the Emperor.

74
00:09:07,270 --> 00:09:08,870
Brilliant move, Commander.

75
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,670
Impressive.

76
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,850
Since the late emperor's time,

77
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:18,960
you have relied on Eunuch Xia
as your backer,

78
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:22,440
leaving chronic problems in Hengtang.

79
00:09:22,790 --> 00:09:24,520
First, officials at all levels

80
00:09:24,750 --> 00:09:25,720
invented various excuses

81
00:09:25,720 --> 00:09:27,380
to increase taxes and corvée,

82
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:29,080
overwhelming the common people

83
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,720
and causing them to lose their land.

84
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:33,780
The noble families took the opportunity
to annex land,

85
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,870
expanding their estates.

86
00:09:36,270 --> 00:09:37,530
Once they grew strong,

87
00:09:38,030 --> 00:09:39,830
they began to conceal their land

88
00:09:39,910 --> 00:09:41,240
and pay fewer taxes.

89
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:44,200
With officials protecting each other,

90
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:45,960
Hengtang

91
00:09:46,670 --> 00:09:48,270
had long been impenetrable.

92
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:53,460
My father proposed the Equalization Law

93
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:56,120
to remeasure land nationwide

94
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,290
and levy taxes by the mu.

95
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,550
Those with more land would pay more,

96
00:10:00,550 --> 00:10:01,620
those with less would pay less,

97
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:03,270
and those with none would pay nothing.

98
00:10:03,270 --> 00:10:06,730
Taking money from noble families
to relieve disaster victims

99
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:09,120
and equalizing the burden
of taxes and corvée

100
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:11,870
would greatly narrow the absurd gap

101
00:10:11,870 --> 00:10:14,150
between the rich and poor in Hengtang.

102
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:16,270
Yes.

103
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:19,360
This is indeed a disruptive policy.

104
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:21,040
But what it disrupts

105
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:24,750
is the lives of you corrupt officials
and noble families.

106
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:28,010
But have you ever thought about it?

107
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,130
If taxes and corvée are equalized,

108
00:10:30,670 --> 00:10:32,750
from how many noble families' pockets

109
00:10:32,750 --> 00:10:34,080
will the money be taken?

110
00:10:34,600 --> 00:10:35,660
No matter how much,

111
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,860
they still have to pay.

112
00:10:40,390 --> 00:10:41,850
My father was benevolent.

113
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:43,270
Though he had a good plan,

114
00:10:43,670 --> 00:10:46,270
he didn't get to enforce it
on any noble family.

115
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,670
Then I'll make

116
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,150
the first strike,

117
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:55,740
starting right here with you,
Commissioner Hu.

118
00:11:05,670 --> 00:11:08,270
The late Emperor
lacked the resolve to do this.

119
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:10,960
Will the current Emperor

120
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,110
really do it?

121
00:11:12,390 --> 00:11:13,390
Let me remind you,

122
00:11:13,510 --> 00:11:14,550
we should not

123
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,630
both become bait.

124
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,120
Commissioner Hu.

125
00:11:28,550 --> 00:11:29,670
Once you fall,

126
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:32,540
the new emperor will see the court's

127
00:11:32,630 --> 00:11:35,030
determination to implement the new policy

128
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,800
and hear the cries of the people.

129
00:11:39,150 --> 00:11:41,410
As long as I accomplish the first strike,

130
00:11:42,360 --> 00:11:44,240
there will naturally be a second

131
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,390
and a third.

132
00:11:47,030 --> 00:11:48,960
Even if the new emperor intends to,

133
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:52,480
extending it from the capital to Hengtang

134
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:54,340
will meet with great resistance.

135
00:11:54,630 --> 00:11:56,630
Your father failed to do this.

136
00:11:57,270 --> 00:12:00,320
Do you really think you can?

137
00:12:04,390 --> 00:12:06,850
Commissioner Hu,
you love drinking so much.

138
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:10,480
Have you ever had the wine
from the Northern Frontier?

139
00:12:12,910 --> 00:12:14,370
In the Northern Frontier,

140
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:16,900
I only drank two kinds of wine.

141
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:20,270
One was on cold nights,

142
00:12:20,670 --> 00:12:22,240
to numb the pain

143
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,930
when it was unbearable.

144
00:12:24,390 --> 00:12:25,270
The other

145
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:28,790
was to see my brothers off when they die

146
00:12:29,670 --> 00:12:31,080
before my eyes in battle.

147
00:12:33,510 --> 00:12:35,150
I often wonder,

148
00:12:36,270 --> 00:12:38,600
when we defend our nations with our lives,

149
00:12:39,790 --> 00:12:41,450
whose homes are we defending?

150
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:45,630
The homes of you corrupt officials
and noble families

151
00:12:45,670 --> 00:12:46,930
who feed on the people?

152
00:12:48,270 --> 00:12:50,330
Foreign enemies are hard to fend off.

153
00:12:50,390 --> 00:12:51,910
But you parasites

154
00:12:52,630 --> 00:12:54,150
must also be eliminated.

155
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:58,250
Although my father is dead,

156
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:02,480
there are fortunately countless people
like him in this world,

157
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:04,080
helping me in secret

158
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:07,320
and paving my way
to the new Emperor's side.

159
00:13:08,870 --> 00:13:10,120
My father's ideal...

160
00:13:12,150 --> 00:13:13,320
Our ideal,

161
00:13:14,600 --> 00:13:15,390
is now

162
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:18,200
almost achieved.

163
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:22,140
Speaking of which,

164
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:24,920
I must thank your good brother-in-law.

165
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,670
If it weren't for his help,

166
00:13:26,670 --> 00:13:28,600
it wouldn't have progressed so quickly.

167
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:30,910
He handed over all the evidence
of the crimes committed

168
00:13:30,910 --> 00:13:32,270
by you and Eunuch Xia.

169
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,450
My brother-in-law,

170
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,270
Xie Shu,

171
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,370
cut off his tail to survive.

172
00:13:44,750 --> 00:13:48,630
You instigated him
to frame my father back then.

173
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:51,060
Now, he's repeating his old trick

174
00:13:51,470 --> 00:13:54,610
to bring down your Zuixian Tavern.

175
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:57,150
It is the ending you deserve.

176
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:01,080
Your father

177
00:14:01,630 --> 00:14:02,830
was indeed innocent.

178
00:14:04,150 --> 00:14:05,750
He was truly incorruptible.

179
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:08,720
I spent over a month

180
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:10,910
fabricating many of his crimes,

181
00:14:11,790 --> 00:14:14,120
but the late Emperor didn't believe them.

182
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,200
It was Xie Shu

183
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:20,030
who personally forged the false evidence

184
00:14:20,030 --> 00:14:22,550
that your father,
as the Jiangnan Transport Commissioner,

185
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:24,790
profited from canal transport.

186
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:27,510
This finally angered the late Emperor,

187
00:14:27,510 --> 00:14:30,110
causing the extermination
of the Shen family.

188
00:14:31,030 --> 00:14:32,890
After your Zuixian Tavern falls,

189
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:34,270
the next

190
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,420
will be the Xie Residence.

191
00:14:36,670 --> 00:14:37,840
I just want to

192
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:40,000
remind you of something.

193
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:42,030
Do you really think Xie Shu

194
00:14:42,030 --> 00:14:43,560
turned against your father

195
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:46,120
just to get a promotion?

196
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:47,910
Couldn't it be

197
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:53,910
that your father

198
00:14:54,750 --> 00:14:56,390
knew some

199
00:14:56,870 --> 00:14:59,510
huge secret about Xie Shu?

200
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:01,670
You mean,

201
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:05,960
there's another story behind this?

202
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:08,490
When I was investigating your father,

203
00:15:09,750 --> 00:15:11,350
I accidentally learned that

204
00:15:11,510 --> 00:15:14,240
at the last moment before he went
to the Censorate for interrogation,

205
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,410
he told this matter

206
00:15:15,510 --> 00:15:17,880
to your wife's birth mother,

207
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:20,440
Jin Chunqing.

208
00:15:34,200 --> 00:15:35,080
Shen.

209
00:15:36,720 --> 00:15:37,750
It's already nice that you're visiting.

210
00:15:37,750 --> 00:15:39,480
Why did you bring so many gifts?

211
00:15:39,510 --> 00:15:40,950
You are too kind.

212
00:15:41,150 --> 00:15:42,360
I was just passing by,

213
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:44,360
so I brought you some New Year goods.

214
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:47,150
That day, my father

215
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,510
took me to Yunya's house.

216
00:15:52,790 --> 00:15:53,630
So it was to...

217
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,670
Well,

218
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:01,790
I've said what I should.

219
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:11,510
What an exquisite wine cup.

220
00:16:12,270 --> 00:16:13,270
It's a pity

221
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:16,980
it's containing this.

222
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:36,720
Commissioner Hu.

223
00:16:38,840 --> 00:16:40,100
Your defeat is sealed.

224
00:16:40,630 --> 00:16:42,290
Looking back on this journey,

225
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:44,610
have you ever regretted it?

226
00:16:49,910 --> 00:16:51,040
A defeat is a defeat.

227
00:16:53,270 --> 00:16:54,600
What is there to regret?

228
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:12,680
Qingyuan.

229
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:14,140
It's rare for you to visit.

230
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:15,160
Today,

231
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:17,020
I will show off my skills so you can

232
00:17:17,400 --> 00:17:18,859
have a taste of my cooking.

233
00:17:19,550 --> 00:17:20,349
Have a seat.

234
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:22,730
I'll be done in a minute.

235
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:23,880
Coming.

236
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:24,790
Smells so good.

237
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:28,250
Are you planning to open a restaurant,
Second Young Master?

238
00:17:28,349 --> 00:17:29,590
Oh, stop calling me that.

239
00:17:29,590 --> 00:17:30,920
Maybe not a restaurant,

240
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:33,000
but I might open a tavern someday.

241
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:35,960
But I really didn't expect this.

242
00:17:37,910 --> 00:17:39,610
I'm living a good life now.

243
00:17:40,070 --> 00:17:41,310
Every day, I tend to the farm,

244
00:17:41,310 --> 00:17:42,240
feed the chickens,

245
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:43,110
have simple meals,

246
00:17:43,110 --> 00:17:44,510
and live a carefree life.

247
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:46,240
As for matters of the Xie family,

248
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:47,160
I don't know,

249
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:48,240
and don't care.

250
00:17:48,310 --> 00:17:49,790
I'm not cut out for it anyway.

251
00:17:49,790 --> 00:17:50,640
Baoxian,

252
00:17:51,070 --> 00:17:52,070
come visit often.

253
00:17:56,350 --> 00:17:57,270
Zhengjun,

254
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:59,010
I'm hungry.

255
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:00,440
When will it be ready?

256
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:02,550
Mother, it's almost done.

257
00:18:02,550 --> 00:18:03,210
It's ready.

258
00:18:03,750 --> 00:18:04,440
Coming.

259
00:18:08,590 --> 00:18:09,480
Come on.

260
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:10,480
Here.

261
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:18,590
Come.

262
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,000
Let's eat.

263
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:21,480
Here.

264
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:23,090
Here, Qingyuan.

265
00:18:24,510 --> 00:18:25,480
Qingyuan.

266
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:26,680
I'm so happy

267
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:28,400
that you could come today.

268
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:32,070
Mother.

269
00:18:32,310 --> 00:18:32,960
Mother,

270
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:34,720
let's eat.

271
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:35,480
Eat.

272
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:37,920
Is Zhenglun still studying?

273
00:18:38,550 --> 00:18:39,080
Zheng...

274
00:18:39,110 --> 00:18:39,910
Call him over.

275
00:18:43,310 --> 00:18:44,030
Zhenglun!

276
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:44,880
Brother.

277
00:18:44,880 --> 00:18:47,280
-Zhenglun, come and eat.
-Come out and eat.

278
00:18:47,830 --> 00:18:49,760
Look at you, you're always so slow.

279
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:51,350
Mother was calling you.

280
00:18:51,350 --> 00:18:52,160
Hurry.

281
00:18:52,270 --> 00:18:53,240
-Sit down.
-Sit down.

282
00:18:53,240 --> 00:18:54,030
Sit down.

283
00:18:55,830 --> 00:18:56,590
Lun.

284
00:18:56,810 --> 00:18:58,200
-Studying is hard work.
-Let’s eat.

285
00:18:58,200 --> 00:18:59,750
Don't exhaust yourself.

286
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:01,000
Come.

287
00:19:01,200 --> 00:19:01,830
Eat.

288
