00:36:03,760 --> 00:36:05,020
More than10 years ago,

578
00:36:05,550 --> 00:36:06,590
it was Xie Shu

579
00:36:07,150 --> 00:36:09,000
who personally killed

580
00:36:09,920 --> 00:36:10,920
his father.

581
00:36:15,920 --> 00:36:17,850
I couldn't figure it out back then.

582
00:36:18,960 --> 00:36:21,490
Xie Shu was just born days before

583
00:36:21,550 --> 00:36:23,100
Old Master Xie's death.

584
00:36:23,510 --> 00:36:25,510
How could he have killed his father?

585
00:36:26,230 --> 00:36:27,800
Then I realized

586
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:30,190
the only possibility.

587
00:36:34,190 --> 00:36:36,110
You actually guessed it.

588
00:36:41,280 --> 00:36:43,800
You knew Xie Shu killed your birth mother.

589
00:36:44,190 --> 00:36:45,520
Why didn't you kill him?

590
00:36:47,000 --> 00:36:48,270
Are you scared?

591
00:36:48,840 --> 00:36:51,400
Are you scared because
you've never killed anyone?

592
00:36:51,400 --> 00:36:53,880
Are you afraid of the feeling

593
00:36:54,920 --> 00:36:57,810
of a life slipping through your fingers?

594
00:37:10,390 --> 00:37:12,790
[Qinyue Corridor]

595
00:37:16,920 --> 00:37:19,120
Fifth Concubine, what brings you here?

596
00:37:23,510 --> 00:37:25,400
[Qinyue Corridor]

597
00:37:25,760 --> 00:37:27,510
You lowly performer,

598
00:37:28,030 --> 00:37:31,230
do you really think
you're fit to live in Danyue Pavilion?

599
00:37:35,190 --> 00:37:37,400
The courtyard
was arranged by the Old Madam.

600
00:37:37,400 --> 00:37:38,760
-If you have any complaints,
-Chunqing.

601
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:39,480
you can...

602
00:37:39,840 --> 00:37:40,480
Shut up!

603
00:37:42,480 --> 00:37:43,670
What are you doing?

604
00:37:43,670 --> 00:37:44,530
Concubine Xia!

605
00:37:46,110 --> 00:37:46,970
Let me tell you,

606
00:37:47,400 --> 00:37:49,430
I'll give you 3 days to move out.

607
00:37:52,400 --> 00:37:53,480
That day,

608
00:37:54,150 --> 00:37:56,000
I finally found a chance

609
00:37:57,760 --> 00:38:00,050
to not only eliminate two threats,

610
00:38:00,960 --> 00:38:02,760
but also use this secret

611
00:38:02,760 --> 00:38:04,440
to threaten Xie Shu.

612
00:38:09,480 --> 00:38:12,140
I know you hate Xia Yingying
to the core, My Lord.

613
00:38:16,510 --> 00:38:19,440
But you can't make a move
because of her great-uncle.

614
00:38:21,110 --> 00:38:22,170
It doesn't matter.

615
00:38:22,590 --> 00:38:23,500
I...

616
00:38:24,150 --> 00:38:25,670
am willing to be of help.

617
00:38:34,510 --> 00:38:35,400
Fifth Madam,

618
00:38:35,550 --> 00:38:38,190
Fourth Madam told me to bring you
this pregnancy tonic.

619
00:38:38,190 --> 00:38:40,030
She also said she would

620
00:38:40,030 --> 00:38:42,890
-move out of Danyue Pavilion soon.
-Leave it there.

621
00:39:55,590 --> 00:39:56,360
Let go!

622
00:39:56,550 --> 00:39:57,800
Let go of me!

623
00:39:58,150 --> 00:39:59,670
Let go of me!

624
00:39:59,670 --> 00:40:01,300
-Why did you hurt me?
-It’s not me!

625
00:40:01,300 --> 00:40:02,190
Let go!

626
00:40:02,190 --> 00:40:03,230
I'll kill you!

627
00:40:24,510 --> 00:40:26,180
It wasn't me.

628
00:40:31,070 --> 00:40:32,090
It wasn't me!

629
00:40:43,070 --> 00:40:44,030
Qingrong.

630
00:41:12,550 --> 00:41:13,590
That day,

631
00:41:16,190 --> 00:41:18,110
I was going to strangle her.

632
00:41:26,360 --> 00:41:27,760
But I just couldn't do it.

633
00:41:39,070 --> 00:41:40,030
Somebody, help!

634
00:41:40,030 --> 00:41:41,110
Someone is dead!

635
00:41:42,670 --> 00:41:43,270
Qingrong.

636
00:41:44,190 --> 00:41:46,590
Shall we have some tangyuan soup together?

637
00:41:46,760 --> 00:41:47,890
Good girl, let's go.

638
00:41:53,590 --> 00:41:55,320
Thank goodness, I didn't do it.

639
00:41:57,920 --> 00:42:00,230
That's how Qingrong became my daughter.

640
00:42:04,480 --> 00:42:08,320
I burned Soul-Suppressing Mantras
every day

641
00:42:09,140 --> 00:42:11,690
just to suppress Xia Yingying's soul.

642
00:42:12,480 --> 00:42:14,140
I didn't want her to come back.

643
00:42:14,550 --> 00:42:15,230
I didn't want her to come back

644
00:42:15,230 --> 00:42:16,210
and tell my daughter

645
00:42:16,210 --> 00:42:17,960
what I did to her mother

646
00:42:17,960 --> 00:42:19,680
and the harm I caused her!

647
00:42:19,840 --> 00:42:21,970
So you not only killed my mother,

648
00:42:22,110 --> 00:42:23,480
but also almost killed me too!
